    <summary>Quick file search and app launcher for Windows with community-made plugins</summary>
    <description>Flow Launcher is a quick file search and app launcher for Windows, with a large ecosystem of community-made plugins.

Dedicated to making your workflow more seamless. Search applications, files, bookmarks, web results, and more — open source and built with the community.

### Features

- Search and launch apps, files, and file contents (Everything or Windows Index)
- Web searches, browser bookmarks, calculator, and shell commands
- System commands (shutdown, lock, settings, and more)
- Plugin Store with plugins in C#, F#, Python, JavaScript, or TypeScript
- Themes, animations, preview panel, and Game Mode
- Customizable hotkey (default Alt+Space)

![Screenshot](https://cdn.statically.io/gh/Aurocosh/chocolatey-packages/master/automatic/flowlauncher/img/screenshot.png)

